            <ul>
              <li>Published economic commentary in <em>Swarajya</em> on India's growth, industrial policy, and economic development.</li>
              <li>Built a fiscal exposure model for a proposed AI credit guarantee scheme (ADSBG), benchmarking against CGTMSE and CGSS growth trajectories; flagged a Year-1 fee-to-payout shortfall of Rs 195 Cr under base-case default assumptions.</li>
              <li>Modelled CGTMSE's guarantee exposure under flat vs risk-tiered pricing through FY30, quantifying an unpriced contingent liability gap of Rs 15.02 lakh crore — 37% of flat-rate exposure — against CAG-audited leverage data.</li>
