            <div class="case-example">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom:0.4em;">Listleri Packaging Transition Strategy</h4>
              <p style="margin-bottom:0.6em;">
                The brief: eliminate single-use plastic across all product lines — still
                water, carbonated drinks, and juice — without eroding market leadership.
                Our framework phased the transition over three stages: <strong>Compliance</strong>
                (Month 0–6, fast rollout via proven external suppliers — fibre bottles,
                aluminium cans, and Tetrapak cartons by product line), <strong>Optimisation</strong>
                (Month 6–18, reducing supplier dependency and launching a closed-loop deposit
                return scheme for aluminium), and <strong>Ownership</strong> (Month 18+, an
                in-house R&amp;D packaging blend and a fully closed-loop system positioned for
                licensing to other FMCGs).
              </p>
              <a href="/files/DeBeers_CaseComp.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download the full deck (.pdf) →</a>
